  "prefLabel": "Cor 306.02 Contraband on Departmental Property Prohibited",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Cor 306.02 Contraband on Departmental Property Prohibited. The possession, transport, introduction, use, sale or storage of contraband on departmental property shall be prohibited under the provisions of RSA 622:24 and RSA 622:25.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Cor 300) #12502, eff 3-23-18",
